<title>GERMANY: German construction investment seen falling.</title>
<headline>German construction investment seen falling.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German construction industry expects building investment in 1997 to fall a real 1.4 percent in west Germany and four to five percent in east Germany, an industry group said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Hauptverband der Deutschen Bauindustrie said it sees no turnaround in construction output before 1998.</p>
<p>Construction investment shrank three percent in the west and 1.7 percent in the east in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
